        <p>These are proposed test scenarios and illustrative calculations, not observed supplier results. Contribution equals AOV × (gross margin rate − discount rate), assuming fixed product cost; discount loss equals AOV × discount rate, before messaging, shipping, taxes, returns and other variable costs. Timings below are separate test variants, not a combined send schedule. Channel suggestions require current integration and sending-capability checks for each product. Before each send, the queue owner must recheck current purchase, stock and suppression state, purpose-specific permission and quiet hours, and deduplicate replayed events.</p>
        <p>ActiveCampaign vs Recart: scenario 1 — logged-in repeat buyer with saved address. At $409 AOV and 68% margin, full-price recovery contributes $278.12 vs $245.40 after a 8% code (Δ $32.72). Ladder touch 1 favors push nudge; watch for SMS after 9pm local without quiet hours. Email 1 ~56m, email 2 ~18h, SMS branch ~4h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>ActiveCampaign vs Recart: scenario 2 — international shipping quote sticker shock. At $409 AOV and 68% margin, full-price recovery contributes $278.12 vs $245.40 after a 8% code (Δ $32.72). Ladder touch 2 favors no-discount assist; watch for no suppression after partial refund. Email 1 ~56m, email 2 ~18h, SMS branch ~4h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>ActiveCampaign vs Recart: scenario 3 — subscription toggle left on at checkout. At $409 AOV and 68% margin, full-price recovery contributes $278.12 vs $245.40 after a 8% code (Δ $32.72). Ladder touch 3 favors email proof; watch for attribution credit on would-have-returned orders. Email 1 ~56m, email 2 ~18h, SMS branch ~4h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>ActiveCampaign vs Recart: scenario 4 — first-time mobile shopper on Instagram traffic. At $409 AOV and 68% margin, full-price recovery contributes $278.12 vs $245.40 after a 8% code (Δ $32.72). Ladder touch 4 favors SMS urgency; watch for recovery for fully OOS cart. Email 1 ~56m, email 2 ~18h, SMS branch ~4h for opted-in only.</p>
